{"overview":"در این برنامه، متقاضیان منتخب هر یک یک شیء کنجکاوی، نادر یا عتیقه که همراه خود آورده‌اند، به نمایش می‌گذارند. پس از دریافت تخصص خود، فرصت دارند در همان محل، اثر خود را به یک پودیم پنج‌نفره متغیر برای فروش ارائه دهند و در ایده‌آل، آن را به بالاترین پیشنهاددهنده به «بارس» (نقد) بفروشند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"In the show, selected applicants each present a curiosity, rarity or antique they have brought with them. Once they have received their expertise, they will have the opportunity on site to offer their exhibit to a changing five-person podium for sale and, ideally, to sell it to the highest bidder for „Bares“ (\"cash\").","tagline_en":"","runtime":45,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":39,"y":2017,"poster":"/udMFphYMcWhxyA1s35GGb1sTYzN.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":6,"y":2013,"poster":"/lKg5Cf4QkYhGxrIcpWamS8FXhhD.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":19,"y":2014,"poster":"/bzajryO7Xd0PG20gUPUDiwZ8pTT.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":6,"y":2014,"poster":"/eE2VjmskhVMOxpE1E6FQQGtSAKL.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":51,"y":2015,"poster":"/egQ6ooEjDCYjDJDbWptUZtMl2Qx.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":7,"y":2015,"poster":"/w9nHAR9oRkrRXl1UvvrvyiP4sYT.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":106,"y":2015,"poster":"/oWgdh1gCSqSHFKSHUEx6ZPCdCtn.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":208,"y":2016,"poster":"/t5tH1eNpvcSsMvcnXDnZiaB7XgG.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":80,"y":2017,"poster":"/faCH3aO4cu8sPpXw6zgnZK5p7KQ.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":229,"y":2018,"poster":"/gaIj5BIu1QZ9m6EylRjnjN4Tsaz.jpg"},{"n":10,"name":"فصل 10","ep":240,"y":2019,"poster":"/8ijILm53O1h2rlLr3m7DpnyVoIf.jpg"},{"n":11,"name":"فصل 11","ep":240,"y":2020,"poster":"/pXJi3A0LKf2fXJRiTTxDbkWdMZX.jpg"},{"n":12,"name":"فصل 12","ep":231,"y":2021,"poster":"/1bPsmv3nEt4y1K3N9YPQjpzzUey.jpg"},{"n":13,"name":"فصل 13","ep":223,"y":2022,"poster":"/xpPkpKBUf3MgmoszB2LI32IUBBm.jpg"},{"n":14,"name":"فصل 14","ep":227,"y":2023,"poster":"/f4FX84IWgSxq0jE17MUD3hPhcGW.jpg"},{"n"